  "52": {"title":"Power","year":"2024","details":"New York City, NY · 35mm","description":"On the East River at 14th Street, Con Edison's East River Generating Station produces both electricity and steam for Manhattan. Its steam feeds the largest district steam system in the United States, heating and cooling buildings across the island through pipes beneath the streets.","tags":["Film Photography","35mm Film","Color Photography","Industrial","Architecture","Con Edison","Power Plant","East River"]},
